Colon fence separator must be a space

```
:::	note
x
:::
.
<p>:::	note
x
:::</p>
```

```
::: 	note
x
:::
.
<p>::: 	note
x
:::</p>
```

```
:::	 note
x
:::
.
<p>:::	 note
x
:::</p>
```

```
:::	[First]
x
:::
.
<p>:::	[First]
x
:::</p>
```

```
::: 	[First]
x
:::
.
<p>::: 	[First]
x
:::</p>
```

```
:::	|
x
:::
.
<p>:::	|
x
:::</p>
```

```
::: 	|
x
:::
.
<p>::: 	|
x
:::</p>
```

```
:::	\
x
:::
.
<p>:::	<br>
x
:::</p>
```

```
::: 	\
x
:::
.
<p>::: 	<br>
x
:::</p>
```

```
:::  note
x
:::
.
<aside class="admonition note">
  <p>x</p>
</aside>
```
